meta {
  name: Weather by City Name
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  `GET /weather/city`

  Get weather by city name, optionally narrowed by state (US only) and country.

  | Param         | Required | Default  | Notes                                 |
  | ------------- | -------- | -------- | ------------------------------------- |
  | `cityName`    | yes      | -        | e.g. `London`                         |
  | `stateCode`   | no       | -        | US only, e.g. `TX`                    |
  | `countryCode` | no       | -        | ISO 3166 alpha-2, e.g. `GB`           |
  | `units`       | no       | `Metric` | `Standard` \| `Metric` \| `Imperial`  |
  | `lang`        | no       | -        | Two-letter language code              |

  City names are ambiguous across countries. Prefer **Weather by City ID** when
  you need a guaranteed-unique location.
}
